# LINQ surface lives once in the shared .NET component resolver
# (`platforms/dotnet/.../component_classes_linq.rs`, class `IEnumerable`),
# resolved by receiver type — or by method name for untyped receivers on the
# .NET path — so VB declares NO per-function LINQ entries. Same shared surface
